WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:02.950
11:47 pm. Your Mac is still working.

2
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:04.600
[Night falls over a painted starry sky.]

3
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:10.600
AI agents, downloads, renders…
[On the Mac, an AI agent is working and a file is downloading.]

4
00:00:11.100 --> 00:00:15.300
You close the lid.
Normally, it falls asleep…

5
00:00:16.300 --> 00:00:21.600
Your Mac sleeps only when you want it to.
Even with the lid closed: the download and the tests finish.

6
00:00:22.500 --> 00:00:27.900
No Wi-Fi? It joins your iPhone, on its own.
[The Mac connects to “My iPhone” Personal Hotspot.]

7
00:00:28.600 --> 00:00:33.100
[Menu bar: one click on “Always awake”, the moon opens its eye.]
One switch.

8
00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:37.500
Nuit Blanche. Your Mac stays up. You don’t have to.
Free · for Mac — connected-mate.github.io/nuit-blanche
